      SL(2,5) = 2I: NOT FOUND;
      each found copy has its central involution NON-central in W(E7)
      (check 5h) -- present, but never over the hinge.

  WHAT W(E7) PROVABLY DOES NOT CONTAIN:
    Any non-split Schur cover OVER THE +- HINGE: impossible for every
